  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.30 Single-ply roof membrane adhesive primer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.30 “Single-ply roof membrane adhesive primer” means any primer labeled for use to clean and promote adhesion of single-ply roof membrane seams or splices prior to bonding.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
